= Instructions

Add @Vodka{2 oz}, @Coffee liqueur{1/2 oz}, @Espresso{1 oz} and @Simple syrup{1/4 oz} to a #Cocktail shaker{} 
filled with @Ice{} and shake until well-chilled.

Strain into a chilled #Cocktail glass{}.

Garnish with @Coffee beans{3}.